+// (xbr/shaders/super-xbr/super-xbr-pass{0,1,2}.glsl). Define XBR_PASS before including:
+//   0: source -> 1x, 1: 1x -> 2x (also reads the original from s_samplers[1]), 2: 2x -> 2x
+// Samplers must be nearest and normalized; colors stay in the encoded (gamma) space.
+//
